				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2015 01:03:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Snowskeeper</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1513970</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Not a huge fan of the -087 name-drop. I know this is a stupid, subjective complaint, but it doesn't feel artistic enough in architecture or anomalous effect to be AWCY&#8212;certainly not to the point where the other members of the group would compliment its designer. It's scary if it's its own thing that's happening for what appears to be no reason, but as something that was manufactured, it's the equivalent of &quot;and then a skeleton popped out.&quot;</p> <p>Still going to rate this article up; just felt it was worth running my mouth about for a couple seconds.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
